cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Inference-Sufficient Representations for High-Throughput Measurement:
  Lessons from Lossless Compression Benchmarks in 4D-STEM
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite the manuscript.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/ondrejdyck/4d-stem-compression-benchmark-public
abstract: >-
  Benchmark of thirteen lossless compression implementations on five 4D-STEM
  datasets, together with the code that produces every figure and table in the
  accompanying manuscript, and a multislice simulation whose generating
  description is known exactly so that the shortest code for its counts can be
  computed rather than estimated.
keywords:
  - 4D-STEM
  - scanning transmission electron microscopy
  - lossless compression
  - HDF5
  - Blosc
  - data reduction
  - information theory
  - multislice simulation
